{"title": "A is for Azuth, and other Gods", "pageid": 55604, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods", "categories": ["Lore", "Book Series"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>A is for Azuth, and other Gods</b> is a series of books in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>The series <i>A is for Azuth, and other Gods</i> contains a collection of children's rhymes about <a href=\"/wiki/Deities\" title=\"Deities\">deities</a>. All parts of the series are written by an unknown author.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_I\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods I\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_I\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods I\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods I</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_II\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods II\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_II\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods II\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods II</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_III\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods III\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_III\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods III\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods III</a></span></li>\n<li>A is for Azuth, and other Gods IV<sup id=\"cite_ref-missing_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-missing-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>A is for Azuth, and other Gods V<sup id=\"cite_ref-missing_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-missing-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_VI\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods VI\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_VI\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods VI\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods VI</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_VII\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods VII\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_VII\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods VII\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods VII</a></span></li>\n<li>A is for Azuth, and other Gods VIII<sup id=\"cite_ref-missing_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-missing-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_IX\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods IX\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Book_Tome_X_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_IX\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods IX\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods IX</a></span></li>\n<li>A is for Azuth, and other Gods X<sup id=\"cite_ref-missing_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-missing-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_XI\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods XI\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_XI\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods XI\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods XI</a></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Collated_Text\">Collated Text</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Amaunator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amaunator\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Amaunator\">Amaunator</a></span>, sun's bright light\n</p><p>Shines the truth into man's laws.\n</p><p>Speak His name to stop a fight;\n</p><p>Then, invoke a legal clause.\n</p><p><br>\nBeware dread <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Asmodeus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Asmodeus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Asmodeus\">Asmodeus</a></span>\n</p><p>Both His word and promise sweet.\n</p><p>More able to betray us\n</p><p>Than the devils at His feet.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Auril\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auril\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Auril\">Auril</a></span> is merciless and cold\n</p><p>the winter's icy breath.\n</p><p>Spare Her a little food and gold;\n</p><p>So you won't freeze to death.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Azuth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Azuth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Azuth\">Azuth</a></span>, the god of wizards all\n</p><p>Who spend their whole lives learning.\n</p><p>He grants their spells both big and small,\n</p><p>For <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/30px-Mystra_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/40px-Mystra_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a> always yearning.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/13px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/19px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/26px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/13px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\">Bane</a> the tyrant, the Black Hand\n</p><p>Makes sure the strong do rule.\n</p><p>He spreads His darkness through the land,\n</p><p>Praised by the harsh and cruel.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beshaba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beshaba\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beshaba\">Beshaba</a></span> will bring forth your doom\n</p><p>Unless you chant Her prayer.\n</p><p>Split from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tymora\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tymora\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tymora\">Tymora</a></span> in the womb,\n</p><p>She brings bad luck to spare.\n</p><p><br>\nYou should not ever pray to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/29px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/39px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>,\n</p><p>The savage Lord of Murder,\n</p><p>His worshipers are killers all\n</p><p>who spread His darkness further.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chauntea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chauntea\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chauntea\">Chauntea</a></span> is our Mother Great,\n</p><p>Hers is the hearth and home.\n</p><p>Our harvests on Her blessing wait\n</p><p>Thus we reap what we've sown.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cyric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cyric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cyric\">Cyric</a></span> is the prince of strife,\n</p><p>God of deceit and madness.\n</p><p>Watch for the Dark Sun and His lies,\n</p><p>Who'll rob your bonds of gladness.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ilmater\" title=\"Ilmater\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Ilmater_Icon.webp/18px-Ilmater_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Ilmater_Icon.webp/28px-Ilmater_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Ilmater_Icon.webp/37px-Ilmater_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ilmater\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Ilmater_Icon.webp/18px-Ilmater_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Ilmater_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ilmater\" title=\"Ilmater\">Ilmater</a> hears the martyr's cries,\n</p><p>Takes in the ill and the oppressed.\n</p><p>When one to help the others dies,\n</p><p>Then by Ilmater they are blessed.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Jergal\" title=\"Jergal\">Jergal</a>, or so it's often said,\n</p><p>Once gave away his bony throne.\n</p><p>For <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kelemvor\" title=\"Kelemvor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Kelemvor_Icon.webp/20px-Kelemvor_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Kelemvor_Icon.webp/30px-Kelemvor_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Kelemvor_Icon.webp/40px-Kelemvor_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kelemvor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Kelemvor_Icon.webp/20px-Kelemvor_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Kelemvor_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kelemvor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kelemvor\">Kelemvor</a> he tracks the dead,\n</p><p>Makes sure that dead souls do not roam.\n</p><p><br>\nKelemvor, Lord of the Dead,\n</p><p>Will take your hand when death arrives.\n</p><p>Makes sure souls are correctly led\n</p><p>To all their proper afterlives.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Leira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Leira\">Leira</a></span>, Lady of Deception\n</p><p>the goddess who wears many masks.\n</p><p>Invoke Her name - avoid perception\n</p><p>She hides your lies and secret tasks.\n</p><p><br>\nFor joy, to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lliira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lliira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lliira\">Lliira</a></span> you must call\n</p><p>And worship Her through soulfelt dance.\n</p><p>So find Her presence in festhalls;\n</p><p>Do not give idleness a chance.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Loviatar\">Loviatar's</a> pleasure is your pain,\n</p><p>Your scars an offering.\n</p><p>Scourge or candle, whip or cane,\n</p><p>Can your devotion bring.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Milil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Milil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Milil\">Milil</a></span> is the Lord of Song.\n</p><p>Pray to Him for inspiration.\n</p><p>Hear His call and sing along.\n</p><p>Let His art be your salvation.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/20px-Myrkul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/30px-Myrkul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/40px-Myrkul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Myrkul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/20px-Myrkul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\">Myrkul</a> is the lord of death\n</p><p>Of hopelessness and ending things\n</p><p>He'll come for all at their last breath\n</p><p>Lords and peasants, crooks and kings\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/30px-Mystra_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/40px-Mystra_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a>, goddess of all mages--\n</p><p>She provides and tends the weave.\n</p><p>Revered by many through the ages;\n</p><p>All magic we from her receive.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/30px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/40px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selûne\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a> guides us through the night.\n</p><p>She is the moon, the stars her tears.\n</p><p>Her sister tries to douse her light,\n</p><p>But she protects us from our fears.\n</p><p><br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/30px-Shar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/40px-Shar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a> will take your sorrow from you\n</p><p>But beware: her night is dark.\n</p><p>She'll hide your pain, and secrets too.\n</p><p>And all your joy, and all your spark.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Silvanus\" title=\"Silvanus\">Silvanus</a>, god of all that's wild,\n</p><p>Of nature's danger and its charm.\n</p><p>His glory's not to be defiled,\n</p><p>Or you yourself will come to harm.\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-missing-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-missing_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-missing_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-missing_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-missing_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Entries IV, V, VIII, and X are not present in game. Their existence is inferred. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715154641\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.125 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.132 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7066/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 80329/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 34151/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 10/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2682/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.043/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 991676/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  105.135      1 -total\n 62.73%   65.949     83 Template:Trim\n 45.26%   47.587      7 Template:MdRarityItem\n 36.04%   37.887      1 Template:Book_text\n 35.36%   37.174      7 Template:Item_icon\n 29.46%   30.969     20 Template:Icon_link\n 27.87%   29.302     20 Template:Icon_text\n 17.52%   18.424     11 Template:Deity\n 17.50%   18.394     11 Template:FRWiki\n 14.64%   15.393     34 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:55604-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715154641 and revision id 396893. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}